performance_optimizations.implementation:
1. Add staleTime to list queries (30-60s for listings, bookings)
2. Add longer staleTime for static data (5min for categories, configuration)
3. Add gcTime (cacheTime) to keep data in memory during navigation
4. Implement query defaults in QueryClient configuration:
   ```ts
   defaultOptions: {
     queries: {
       staleTime: 30_000, // 30s default
       gcTime: 5 * 60 * 1000, // 5min
     }
   }
   ```
5. Use shorter staleTime for real-time sensitive data (availability: 5s)

1. Copy manualChunks configuration from apps/web/vite.config.ts to backoffice:
   ```ts
   build: {
     rollupOptions: {
       output: {
         manualChunks: (id) => {
           if (id.includes('mapbox-gl')) return 'vendor-mapbox';
           if (id.includes('@tanstack/react-query')) return 'vendor-query';
           if (id.includes('packages/client-sdk')) return 'vendor-sdk';
           if (id.includes('packages/ds') || id.includes('@xala/ds')) return 'vendor-ds';
           if (id.includes('node_modules')) return 'vendor';
         }
       }
     }
   }
   ```
2. Apply same config to minside app
3. Increase chunkSizeWarningLimit to 800

