2. Replace `export * from '@digdir/designsystemet-react'` with explicit named exports:
   ```ts
   export {
     Button,
     Card,
     Heading,
     // ... only used components
   } from '@digdir/designsystemet-react';
   ```
3. Add eslint-plugin-import to detect unused exports
4. Consider using @rollup/plugin-unused for build-time detection
